  <NAME>Multi-virus CRISPR screening data in VeroE6 cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>Multi-virus CRISPR screening data in VeroE6 cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>We report the results of CRISPR survival screens in the context of multiple viral infections. Two sgRNA pools were used: one targeting the SARS-CoV-2 RNA interactome proteins, and one targeting mitochondrially-related proteins. Overall design: Multi-virus CRISPR screening data in VeroE6 cells, sgRNA sequencing results.</DESCRIPTION>
